Package: tabarenaR
Type: Package
Title: Evaluate Any R Learner on the TabArena Benchmark and Compute Its Elo
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marv", "", email = "marv@wrig.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A pure-R implementation of the TabArena evaluation protocol
    (Erickson et al., 2025, <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2506.16791>). Downloads the 51
    TabArena-v0.1 tasks and their official cross-validation splits from OpenML,
    runs any R model exposed through a train() and predict() pair on them,
    scores predictions with the official metrics (ROC AUC, log loss, RMSE),
    pulls the published per-task results of the leaderboard methods, and
    computes the Bradley-Terry Elo rating, win rate, rank, normalized score
    and the other leaderboard columns exactly as the official leaderboard
    does, all without leaving R.
